  :intent "Synthesize a modular conceptual apparatus, streaming context management and event-driven agent coordination in ASN/ASL."
  :scope "Conceptual system design only, as clarified by the user. A small reference policy illustrates semantics; production improvements and implementation scheduling remain separate."
  :sourcePolicy "Inventory the finite local source set; preserve source links and dispositions. External research supports scoped design choices, not universal efficacy claims."
